        "alt": "Simulation based workshop on TURP"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "CIME and the Section of Urology organised a simulation-based workshop on TURP (Trans-Urethral Resection of the Prostate). 21 urology residents from various institutions across Karachi had the valuable opportunity to practice TURP procedures using the VirtaMed simulator, a cutting-edge technology that provides comprehensive training on the essential skills required for performing this intervention."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We believe that such simulation workshops are essential in fostering excellence in the field of urology. By providing practical training opportunities, we aim to enhance the expertise of aspiring urologists and contribute to better patient outcomes."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
